  "body": "## Changelog\n* bfd8599f5bb68a1db6e07f6aa321219533e1b944 Write kubeconfig files readable only by the owner (#5207)\n* d4c20769c16ef6b0baba2e36fc6f089084fbb8da chore(deps): bump google.golang.org/grpc from 1.83.1 to 1.83.2 (#5160)\n* ddbc960cf8d3dd11404b40a7a95b95dd623f804e chore(deps): bump github.com/getsentry/sentry-go from 0.48.0 to 0.49.0 (#5171)\n* f8f8d63364e1868cce6eb120fb6d287efb202ef4 chore(deps): bump github.com/gofrs/flock from 0.13.0 to 0.13.1 (#5177)\n* cda28baa4ea8dc1745cf186b99bc3ddb876c7c24 chore(deps): bump github.com/containerd/containerd/v2 from 2.3.3 to 2.3.5 (#5195)\n* 7306021ae659df6a63bee318bb25ff76c901fc15 chore(deps): bump the tracing group across 1 directory with 2 updates (#5205)\n* c53183cfc64d531dc75a7b9285ea1a9c4fc06375 chore(deps): bump the aws-sdk group across 1 directory with 3 updates (#5159)\n* 403844624489058943f0e8934fa13aa9b8ebc285 deploy: fix Flycast IP allocation on first deploy for default-network apps (#5206)\n* 5cc1ffb51be42c308b50783e72c0c214d02c7b69 Bump fly-go to v0.11.0 (#5204)\n\n"
